<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle prices up $1-$3 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle prices up $1-$3 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers under 600 lbs mostly $1.00-$3.00 per cwt higher, over 600 lbs steady to mostly $2.00 lower on a thin test, compared to the previous week, USDA said. Trade was moderately active.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-650 lbs 73.50- 77.50; 700-750 lbs 63.50-67.75; 799 lbs 65.50; 839 lbs 67.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 610 lbs 64.50; 650-700 lbs 65.00-66.75; 775 lbs 64.50. Supply - 300</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
